**Lessons written for the research lane.** Stratify any ledger figure by the engine's git history before counting "forward n". Cut in/out at the last recipe change, not the time median. Test "is the ledger chance from the scan" as P(mean ≥ observed), not P(sum>0), which changes the answer here from 0.6 to 0.006. Use day blocks for the sign-stability bootstrap.

