- **The positive control is an extreme window.** Among 248 same-day 70-minute windows, the chosen 11:55 window ranks 115th in-sample and 2nd out of sample. Share-type behaviour is generic in direction, but the typical window is −0.5 to −0.9 bp on down days, not −2.7. In-sample, ordinary Asian-hours windows match or exceed the reopen pop on down days.

