| Test | Result |
|---|---|
| Within-cell permutation of the shape variable, 60 cells, 2000 shuffles | max abs t of 2.54 has family-wise p 0.495. Single pre-chosen cell p 0.011. Joint "out-of-sample strong and recent same sign" p 0.051. |
| Non-overlapping sub-windows | 2021-23 t −2.80, 2024-26H1 t −0.60, 2026H1 flips positive. Leave-2021-out drops to t −1.58. |
